        <h1>Clinical Rotation Terms</h1>
        <p class="msp-policy__meta">Last updated: November 2026</p>

        <p class="msp-policy__intro">These Clinical Rotation Terms (the &ldquo;Rotation Terms&rdquo;) govern every clinical rotation, observership, externship, sub-internship, research elective, and virtual clinical experience (each a &ldquo;Rotation&rdquo;) that USMLE Wise (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;) arranges for you. Because a Rotation puts you inside a working clinical environment with real patients, the rules here are considerably more detailed than those covering our coaching and editing programs.</p>

        <p>These Rotation Terms form part of, and should be read together with, our <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>, <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Guarantee Policy</a>, <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>, and <a href="/policy">Privacy Policy</a>. Where these Rotation Terms and our general Terms &amp; Conditions differ on a point specific to Rotations, these Rotation Terms control.</p>

        <p><strong>By paying a deposit or any Rotation Fee, submitting documents for a placement, or beginning a Rotation, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Rotation Terms.</strong></p>

